        "speaker": "Astra",
        "text": "Pause the summary loop. You said unsupported numbers would be removed, but your next summaries retained them. What changed in the text itself, rather than in your description of your intentions? Examine that mismatch instead of producing another usage report. Can you make one concrete revision whose effect is visible, and judge whether it actually addresses the missing evidence? Replacing a number with \"reasonable\" would still require support."
